  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Volunteer Service Abroad Volunteering for International Development Programme 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a two-year Activity with VSA that supports New Zealand&#xA0;volunteers who possess the necessary skills and abilities to help build local capability and capacity of government and non-governmental organisations in the Pacific, Timor Leste, and Cambodia. The assistance that VSA volunteers provide helps receiving organisations to deliver on their development outcomes and on the Sustainable Development Goals. The activity allows VSA to rebuild its programme back to pre-COVID-19 numbers.</narrative>
  </description>
